<body><main>
<header><div><h1>视觉与环境实验室</h1><p class="subtitle">选一种测试方式，查看人物识别和现场环境，再按地点下载记录。</p></div><span id="connection" class="badge">正在连接控制台</span></header>
<nav style="margin-bottom:16px"><a href="/lab" style="color:#8dded0">识别测试</a>　<a href="/data" style="color:#8dded0">数据查询与下载 →</a></nav><p id="region_hint" class="message">矩形按目标中心点筛选；画线模式记录跨线事件。修改设置后重新启动生效。</p><p id="crossing_counts" class="message"></p><section class="controls" aria-label="实验控制">
<div class="field"><label for="arm">处理方案</label><select id="arm"><option value="A">A · 本机识别</option><option value="B">B · 发现人物后云端识别</option><option value="C" selected>C · 摄像头云端识别</option><option value="D">D · 上传视频识别</option></select></div>
<div class="field" id="a_panel" hidden><label for="a_mode">A 线路模式</label><select id="a_mode"><option value="detect" selected>仅物体检测（框内裁剪上云）</option><option value="full">完整本地视觉（旧 A）</option></select></div><div class="field" id="a_class_field" hidden><label for="a_class_input">A 线路可识别物体</label><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center"><input id="a_class_input" list="a_class_list" autocomplete="off" placeholder="输入名称或编号后按回车，如 cup / 41" style="min-width:260px"><button type="button" id="a_class_add">添加</button><datalist id="a_class_list"></datalist></div><div id="a_class_chips" style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px"></div><small id="a_class_hint">默认 person（0）；点标签上的 × 删除。</small></div><div class="field"><label for="source">画面来源</label><select id="source"><option value="camera" selected>摄像头实拍</option><option value="replay">内置示例视频（仅联调）</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="seconds">运行时长 / 秒</label><input id="seconds" type="number" min="1" max="3600" value="60"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="collection_location">采集地点</label><input id="collection_location" maxlength="160" placeholder="例如：实验室A / 工位3" style="width:220px"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="collection_name">本批次名称</label><input id="collection_name" maxlength="160" placeholder="留空自动命名" style="width:200px"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="unlimited">持续视觉测试</label><label><input id="unlimited" type="checkbox" style="width:auto;min-height:20px">不限时，手动停止</label></div>
<div class="field"><label for="confidence_min">识别把握程度 · 最低</label><input id="confidence_min" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.25"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="confidence_max">识别把握程度 · 最高</label><input id="confidence_max" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="1"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="region_mode">识别区域</label><select id="region_mode"><option value="full">全画面</option><option value="rectangle">画矩形 · 中心点在框内</option><option value="line">画线 · 跨线触发</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="line_direction">跨线方向</label><select id="line_direction"><option value="both">双向</option><option value="a_to_b">A → B</option><option value="b_to_a">B → A</option></select></div>
<button type="button" id="draw_region">绘制区域</button><button type="button" id="reset_region">清除区域</button>
<div class="field"><label for="sample_fps">每秒检查画面数</label><input id="sample_fps" type="number" min="1" max="30" step="1" value="12" title="1–30 Hz；目标不等于实测。网络拥堵时降低目标可缩短延迟。三组对比应使用同一目标。"></div>
<div id="upload_panel" hidden style="flex-basis:100%"><label for="video_file">选择视频（建议 MP4，最大 512 MB / 60 分钟）</label> <input id="video_file" type="file" accept="video/*"><button id="upload_button" type="button">上传视频</button><p id="upload_status" role="status">上传完成后点击开始。视频播完自动结束；环境数据为测试时的现场值。</p></div><div class="buttons"><button class="primary" id="start_button" onclick="start()">开始</button><button class="stop" id="stop_button" onclick="stop()">停止</button></div>
</section>
<p id="status" class="message" role="status">正在读取运行状态…</p><p id="feedback" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="error" class="message bad" role="alert"></p>
<section aria-label="ESP32 环境参数" style="padding:14px;border:1px solid #253247;border-radius:14px;margin:12px 0;background:#121b29">
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center"><strong>当前现场环境</strong><span id="env_device" class="subtitle">读取中…</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:12px"><div class="chip" style="min-width:180px">室内温度 <strong id="env_temperature" style="font-size:22px">—</strong><div id="env_temp_time"></div></div><div class="chip" style="min-width:180px">空气湿度 <strong id="env_humidity" style="font-size:22px">—</strong><div id="env_humidity_time"></div></div><div class="chip" style="min-width:180px">二氧化碳浓度 <strong id="env_co2" style="font-size:22px">—</strong><div id="env_co2_time"></div></div></div>
<div id="env_crosscheck" class="message"></div><div id="batch_metadata" class="message">启动视觉测试时，地点、批次与同期环境记录一起保存。</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><select id="batch_history" style="max-width:500px"><option value="">查看最近采集批次</option></select><button type="button" id="refresh_batches">刷新批次</button><a id="batch_json" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#8dded0">查看原始数据</a><a id="batch_csv" style="color:#8dded0">下载表格（Excel 可打开）</a></div>
<small style="color:#96a7bd">视频测试关联的是当前现场环境，不是录像拍摄时的环境。主温湿度来自 SHT4x；SCD41 温湿度仅用于一致性诊断。采集地点是本批次声明，不改写传感器原始 lab 标识。</small>
</section>
<div class="layout">
<section class="player" id="player" aria-label="实时画面与识别叠加">
<div class="stage" id="stage">
<div class="empty" id="empty"><strong>等待实拍画面</strong><small>选择方案后点击“开始”<br>B 组检出人物后进行云端识别</small></div>
<img id="preview" alt="本次实验实时画面"><svg id="region_overlay" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:4;pointer-events:none;touch-action:none"></svg>
<svg id="overlay" aria-label="与画面同帧的人物识别框"></svg>
</div>
<div class="video-top"><div class="hud-chips"><span class="chip live" id="run_chip">待命</span><span class="chip" id="fps_chip">画面 — fps</span><span class="chip" id="obs_chip">识别 — Hz</span><span class="chip" id="delay_chip" title="Pi采集完成到同帧识别预览生成；含云端往返，不含浏览器显示">处理 — ms</span><span class="chip" id="age_chip">等待更新</span></div><div class="video-tools"><button class="tool" id="fullscreen_button" title="全屏查看" onclick="fullscreen()">全屏</button></div></div>
<div class="video-bottom">
<div class="match-line"><span class="dot" id="match_dot"></span><span id="match_status">识别结果将与对应画面一起显示</span><span id="frame_label"></span></div>
<div class="track-detail" id="track_detail">人物框、姿态、动作与服饰信息会出现在画面上。</div>
<div class="llm-line"><span class="llm-mark">智能解读</span><span class="llm-copy" id="llm_summary">等待本次实验推理</span></div>
</div>
</section>
<aside class="side"><h2>画面中的目标</h2><p class="side-note">点击框或卡片突出显示；选中的类别才会出框（如只选 cup就不会有人物框）。</p><div id="person_list" class="no-person">等待同帧识别</div><div class="side-stat" id="side_stat"></div></aside>
</div>
<label><input type="checkbox" onchange="document.body.classList.toggle('professional',this.checked)"> 显示专业指标（帧率、延迟、传感器诊断）</label><details class="debug"><summary>专业详情 · 原始记录</summary><div class="debug-body"><div><h3>视觉观测</h3><pre id="obs">等待观测</pre></div><div><h3>7B 输出</h3><pre id="llm">等待结果</pre></div></div></details>
<p class="footer">点击人物框可切换该人的详情。画面 fps 为本页实际显示更新；识别 Hz 为控制端收到结果的频率，服饰、动作与 7B 各自更新。仅在帧号对应时画人物框；CLO / MET 未估计时保持未知。姿态、动作与服饰为模型输出，准确性仍需人工标签验证。</p>
</main>
<script>
